OL,3,GNEWSAMissed opportunities before
OL,4,Aex-footballer's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest jury has found missed
OL,7,Fopportunities contributed to the death
OL,8,Fof former footballer Colin Flatt, who
OL,9,Fhad Alzheimer's disease.
OL,11,FThe ex-Southend and Cambridge United
OL,12,Fplayer seriously injured himself and
OL,13,Ffell from height at Basildon Hospital
OL,14,Fin July 2021. He later developed an
OL,15,Finfection and died that September.
OL,17,FHis former partner, Melanie Leahy, who
OL,18,Fcampaigned for the Lampard Inquiry into
OL,19,Fmental health deaths in Essex, said she
OL,20,Fdid not want to hear that "lessons had
OL,21,Fbeen learnt" but wanted to know "who
OL,22,Fwould take responsibility".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
